{
  "tema": 6089,
  "slug": "pasiva-refleja-se",
  "titulo": "Forming the passive with se (la pasiva refleja)",
  "subtitulo": "Se vende casa, se venden tablas: the thing decides singular or plural.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Passive se: se + verb in the 3rd person, singular or plural to agree with the thing: se vende carro, se venden carros.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Spanish doesn't use the passive (_the house was sold_) as much as English does. A very common way to say it is with **se**: **se vende casa** = _house for sale_, _a house is being sold_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**se**",
            "verb in 3rd person",
            "thing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works with **transitive** verbs, verbs that take a direct object. **Se** never changes."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The verb **agrees with the thing**: singular thing → singular verb, plural thing → plural verb."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Thing",
            "Verb",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "singular",
              "vende",
              "Se vende carro."
            ],
            [
              "plural",
              "venden",
              "Se venden carros."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in any tense: **se publicaron**, **se han hecho**, **se harán**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: read the sign backwards. **Se venden tablas**: the boards are the ones being sold, so they decide the verb."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Se vende== depa de lujo en la playa.",
              "en": "Luxury apartment for sale at the beach."
            },
